{"answer":"Conditionally, 96 units were originally shipped and 93 usable units remain: 12 cartons × 8 units per carton = 96, then 96 − 3 damaged units = 93. This requires the dispatch, packing, and receiving records to concern one shipment and the 3 damaged units to be included among those 96. The supplied records do not independently establish that linkage.","approaches":[{"description":"Combine the dispatch carton count and carton capacity, then subtract the recorded unusable units under an explicit linkage assumption.","id":"record-arithmetic","outcome":"candidate","reason":"The arithmetic is valid conditionally, while the records lack an identifier or cross-reference proving they describe the same shipment."}],"change_log":["Revised the proof steps to cite the supplied record text directly and to state the cross-record linkage assumption in each conditional computation.","Retained the conditional conclusion; no unconditional shipment or usable-unit total is claimed.","Recorded the two missing linkage facts as unresolved questions rather than treating record attribution as proof that the records concern one shipment."],"claims":[{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"shipment-count","citations":[{"end":41,"quote":"Dispatch record: 12 cartons were shipped.","source_id":"shipment-count","start":0}],"critical":false,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"shipment-cartons","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The dispatch record states that 12 cartons were shipped.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"units-per-carton","citations":[{"end":70,"quote":"Packing specification for this shipment: each carton contains 8 units.","source_id":"units-per-carton","start":0}],"critical":false,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"carton-capacity","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The packing specification states that each carton contains 8 units.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"damage-record","citations":[{"end":69,"quote":"Receiving record: 3 units were damaged in transit and are not usable.","source_id":"damage-record","start":0}],"critical":false,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"damaged-units","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The receiving record states that 3 units were damaged in transit and are not usable.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"additional_assumption","basis_reference":"The supplied records contain no shipment identifier or explicit cross-reference linking all three records, nor evidence that the damaged units are included in the dispatched total.","citations":[],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"same-shipment","kind":"assumption","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"Assume the dispatch, packing, and receiving records concern the same shipment, and that the 3 damaged units are among its shipped units.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"derivation","basis_reference":"Conditional arithmetic in compute-original.","citations":[],"critical":true,"depends_on":["shipment-cartons","carton-capacity","same-shipment"],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"original-units","kind":"deduction","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"Under the same-shipment assumption, 96 units were originally shipped.","step_ids":["compute-original"],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"derivation","basis_reference":"Conditional arithmetic in compute-usable.","citations":[],"critical":true,"depends_on":["original-units","damaged-units","same-shipment"],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"usable-units","kind":"deduction","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"Under the same-shipment assumption, 93 usable units remain.","step_ids":["compute-usable"],"tool_ids":[]}],"open_questions":["What shipment identifier or explicit cross-reference establishes that the dispatch, packing, and receiving records describe the same shipment?","What evidence establishes that the 3 damaged units are included among the 96 units computed from the dispatch and packing records?"],"proof_steps":[{"citations":[{"end":41,"quote":"Dispatch record: 12 cartons were shipped.","source_id":"shipment-count","start":0},{"end":70,"quote":"Packing specification for this shipment: each carton contains 8 units.","source_id":"units-per-carton","start":0}],"depends_on":[],"id":"compute-original","justification":"Under the same-shipment assumption, the cited dispatch count and capacity apply together; 12 × 8 = 96.","statement":"Compute the original shipped-unit count as 96."},{"citations":[{"end":69,"quote":"Receiving record: 3 units were damaged in transit and are not usable.","source_id":"damage-record","start":0}],"depends_on":["compute-original"],"id":"compute-usable","justification":"Under the same-shipment assumption, the cited 3 damaged units are among the 96 computed units; 96 − 3 = 93.","statement":"Compute the remaining usable-unit count as 93."}],"question_status":"answered","tool_requests":[]}
